      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "(Since OP has categorized this as a bug report in the client, and not as general feedback in the website category...)\n\nI'm unable to reproduce. Reporting private avatars is still plausible in client, and more streamlined than the web form ticketing. I can still report users/avatars with evidence ([output logs](https://help.vrchat.com/hc/en-us/articles/9521522810899-Where-do-I-find-my-Output-Logs-and-Crash-Dumps)) via web form ticket when there's no option in the client.\n\nAs for the web form ticketing, user report web form tickets post January 26, 2026 are not auto-closed.\n\nAlso a duplicate of: https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/re-open-moderation-tickets-for-certain-malicious-avatars-known-as-crashers (also miscategorized)",
      "viewerReactions": null,
