      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{639e468235cad333ec7830d8|full_name} It isn't plausible in-client because you can't view avatar details of a Private avatar without being in the same instance as its uploader. If viewing the private avatar crashes you, you can report the user in-app and submit evidence via web form report with \"Full\" output logs or video/screenshot evidence attached.\n\nNote that navigating to \"Avatar Details\" on a yet-to-be loaded avatar will dump its Avatar ID to logs, though this isn't strictly necessary.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
