  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2026-01-29T20:59:35.046Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "I often find myself target of crasher avatars, i always report them when they are set to public, but right now there is no way to report a private avatar using the new reporting system, seeing that reports on the support site were ignored and automatically closed Im confused on what are the steps required to report a malicious avatar that is set to private.\n\nMalicious users are actively taking advantage of this flaw on the new reporting system, please add a way to report private avatars.",
